  "explanation": "The original sources present two distinct but valid claims about Herbert Fulton’s citizenship. Document D1S8 explicitly states that he became a naturalized citizen of the Kingdom of Egypt in 1910. Document D2S2 asserts that he was a citizen of the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland during his lifetime. These are not mutually exclusive: he could have been born a citizen of the UK and later naturalized in Egypt. Both claims are directly supported by their respective documents and do not invalidate each other due to differing temporal contexts."
